<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
Fleet mailbox janitor: once a day at 04:47 WITA (LOCAL time, launchd reads
StartCalendarInterval in the machine's zone, not UTC).

Runs scripts/mailbox_janitor_cron.sh, which applies scripts/mailbox_janitor.py
to ~/.nuzantara-mailbox: dead mail the reader hook renamed to
<name>.<tag>-<ts> is unlinked after 14 days, .broadcast_seen markers whose
broadcasts are no longer live go after 3 days, and session dirs left empty
are removed. Live *.md messages, symlinks, nested dirs and broadcast/ itself
are never touched. Each run appends one JSON receipt line to
~/logs/mailbox-janitor.receipts.jsonl and writes the heartbeat
~/.organism/last_seen/<machine>.mailbox_janitor.json.

This file is tracked as a REAL plist (not .plist.example) on purpose: the
organ conformance gate scans only literal *.plist, so this is what makes the
janitor visible to genes G1..G10. Paths below are Pro/Mini shaped
(/Users/nuzantara/nuzantara). install_mailbox_janitor.sh renders HOME and the
repo root for the machine it runs on (M5 is /Users/balizero), lints the result
with plutil AND plistlib, then bootstraps it.

XML comments must not contain two consecutive hyphens and must not end on
one; plutil accepts such a file but plistlib (what audit_launchd_crons.py
uses) raises ExpatError and the audit layer goes blind.

Install (any machine):
    bash infra/launchagents/install_mailbox_janitor.sh
Uninstall:
    bash infra/launchagents/install_mailbox_janitor.sh uninstall
Kill switch (without removing the plist; the job inherits the launchd user
environment because this plist deliberately does NOT pin the variable, which
would override setenv):
    launchctl setenv MAILBOX_JANITOR_ENABLED false
    (next run writes heartbeat status=disabled; `launchctl unsetenv` re-arms;
    setenv does not survive a reboot, uninstall does)
Dry run by hand:
    python3 scripts/mailbox_janitor.py
-->
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.nuzantara.mailbox-janitor.daily</string>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/bash</string>
        <string>/Users/nuzantara/nuzantara/scripts/mailbox_janitor_cron.sh</string>
    </array>

    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
    <dict>
        <key>Hour</key>
        <integer>4</integer>
        <key>Minute</key>
        <integer>47</integer>
    </dict>

    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>/Users/nuzantara/nuzantara</string>

    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>HOME</key>
        <string>/Users/nuzantara</string>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
    </dict>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/nuzantara/logs/mailbox-janitor.launchd.log</string>

    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/nuzantara/logs/mailbox-janitor.error.log</string>

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <false/>

    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <false/>
</dict>
</plist>
